								Is_the_Full_Customer_Journey_Tracked_from_Inquiry_to_Site_Visit_Booking_Agreement_Payment_Handover as "Is the Full Customer Journey Tracked from Inquiry to Site Visit, Booking, Agreement, Payment, Handover, and Post-Sale Support?"
								Are_Customer_Communications_Across_Calls_Emails_WhatsApp_Site_Visits_and_Documents_Visible_in_One as "Are Customer Communications Across Calls, Emails, WhatsApp, Site Visits, and Documents Visible in One Place?"
								What_Customer_Relationship_Challenges_Occur_Frequently as "What Customer Relationship Challenges Occur Frequently?"
